{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有，X在S13的“可就算听到了”逻辑不够顺，削弱了原本想要保证又明知无法保证的心理矛盾，少数感受意象也稍显堆叠。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X的重点词加亮、话与感受交替呈现，让观众能迅速抓住每段心理转折；感受按音乐节点出现，也更容易边听边接收。小船、水波、漂荡、失重、锚定等意象形成了连续的感官线索，使前后更像同一段经历，音乐细节也比Y更具体。Y的优势是心理因果叙述更完整自然，尤其S13对害怕失去、想收回心意又无法真正收回的矛盾交代得更清楚。整体而言，X更适合边听边扫，也更容易留下细腻而连贯的印象。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dbfcf6a7-13e6-40d9-8dc2-c0c98a647591", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T022642892144Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:28:14.723649+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f621c40264d6f21bcb470c5cc4a22108585a6883c125ddaf6da5ac20741c6df6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582